From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 22:38:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 8/9] Bravery: subscribe to the sources of Brave's default
 lists

Replace the EasyList-only default with the 30 source URLs of the lists Brave
enables by default on Android (list_catalog.json in brave/adblock-resources).
Track added URLs in a list pref, so new URLs reach existing installs and a
list the user removes stays removed.
---
 .../content/browser/ad_block_service.cc       |  3 +-
 .../ad_block_subscription_service_manager.cc  | 95 +++++++++++++++++--
 .../ad_block_subscription_service_manager.h   |  5 +-
 3 files changed, 90 insertions(+), 13 deletions(-)

diff --git a/components/brave_shields/content/browser/ad_block_service.cc b/components/brave_shields/content/browser/ad_block_service.cc
